          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "Aggregation Check",
          "text": "192.168.0.0/24 + 192.168.1.0/24 = 192.168.0.0/23, valid. But .1.0 + .2.0 cannot merge — the /23 holding .1.0 starts at .0.0."
        },
